{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_39", "source_id": "63184122000000000900fcfb", "title": "Covermark粉霜，怼脸测评", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63184122000000000900fcfb", "topic_family": "彩妆与底妆", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 883, "evidence_unit_count": 27, "original_evidence_unit_count": 27, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 82, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 今天要给你们诶链测评这款 Powermark的中草药粉霜", "现在我整张脸看起来就是一个 妆面很完整很好看的一个奶油机", "现在是下午三点四十四分 那我晚一点再来给你们更新过的妆感", "你没有什么粉感的 那我们现在来看一下 它的这个暗沉的情况怎么样", "我觉得这一瓶粉底非常好 可以买", "这个妆效我觉得非常清透 但是又有修饰度 毛孔黑头和痘印修饰的还不错", "我上了粉底 还上了蜜粉 今天就没有用遮墙膏了 因为我觉得它的修饰度还不错"], "retained_quotes": ["这个妆效我觉得非常清透 但是又有修饰度 毛孔黑头和痘印修饰的还不错", "我上了粉底 还上了蜜粉 今天就没有用遮墙膏了 因为我觉得它的修饰度还不错"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63184122000000000900fcfb/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63184122000000000900fcfb/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63184122000000000900fcfb/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63184122000000000900fcfb/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "d9f9b085c3d1bb16020220d1a7a3257a6a51035a35044b6a114357284fbf6e72", "card_hash": "27dbfd07911a6b8bbcd8feeaf9abde87c84263068026f3ab8a5b75bc4b82987e", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_39", "source_id": "63147930000000000900f3e0", "title": "让皮肤变好的从来不是护肤品，而是护肤方式", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63147930000000000900f3e0", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 946, "evidence_unit_count": 22, "original_evidence_unit_count": 22, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["很多人看我现在的皮肤都不相信我是油痘肌，我长了9年痘痘闭口", "1⃣️在皮肤敏感的时候，请你们把别的功效护肤放一边，就专门修护", "抛开内分泌、上火这些体内的因素，长痘痘闭口就是毛孔堵塞了", "） 皮肤粗糙除了毛孔油脂多，还有一个原因是角质太厚了，皮肤已经被堆积的角质弄的暗淡无光", "跟一些贵妇精华比起来真的很便宜了～ #油痘肌大作战[话题]# #油痘肌护肤[话题]# #好皮肤养成记[话题]# #如何拯救痘痘肌[话题]# #痘痘肌肤[话题]# #怎么才能去闭口[话题]# #痘痘肌[话题]# O", "2⃣️长痘痘闭口的时候，在护肤步骤里加个能疏通毛孔的s类护肤品就能解决问题了（先去把脸上的痘痘闭口针清了，再用s，不然闭口全都被s催熟爆成红肿痘）", "（清洁面膜作用太浅，我相信你们人手一罐，但如果有用你们就不会毛孔堵塞长痘痘啦"], "retained_quotes": ["2⃣️长痘痘闭口的时候，在护肤步骤里加个能疏通毛孔的s类护肤品就能解决问题了（先去把脸上的痘痘闭口针清了，再用s，不然闭口全都被s催熟爆成红肿痘）", "（清洁面膜作用太浅，我相信你们人手一罐，但如果有用你们就不会毛孔堵塞长痘痘啦"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63147930000000000900f3e0/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63147930000000000900f3e0/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63147930000000000900f3e0/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63147930000000000900f3e0/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "7ace07d9e3904ba7fcb956ee2366765e2e12135809f5baf8c4849bca6fd2e04e", "card_hash": "2