{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_39", "source_id": "6313284d0000000013039b5e", "title": "六个月，从0到10w粉～感谢小红书感谢你们🎁🙏", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6313284d0000000013039b5e", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 572, "evidence_unit_count": 16, "original_evidence_unit_count": 16, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 41, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 我的粉丝终于到达10万粉啦 我是在今年的2月15号发的", "其实我在一个多月之前我就已经把礼物买好了 但我没想到我9万粉找到10万粉居然找得那么漫长", "再乳化用清水洗掉 它的这个乳化的速度非常快 一点都不用担心因为乳化不彻底而导致长痘痘", "我也买了10份 它的使用感很好 磨布就像果冻一样 浮在脸上冰冰凉凉的", "希望你们的皮肤都变得水淋淋的 那我们下期见 拜拜", "再乳化用清水洗掉 它的这个乳化的速度非常快 一点都不用担心因为乳化不彻底而导致长痘痘", "我决定做博主之后的第一篇笔记 然后在8月26号那天我的粉丝突破了10万大官"], "retained_quotes": ["再乳化用清水洗掉 它的这个乳化的速度非常快 一点都不用担心因为乳化不彻底而导致长痘痘", "我决定做博主之后的第一篇笔记 然后在8月26号那天我的粉丝突破了10万大官"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6313284d0000000013039b5e/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6313284d0000000013039b5e/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6313284d0000000013039b5e/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6313284d0000000013039b5e/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "a4777dc932d34e17a7b86f79f228290d090fb7eb441a8c904442c72cab3accf9", "card_hash": "51ad1c36def7c5aaaa12a7133d12fb77582fc1ddeaa206532bc0a85691debeee", "callable": false, "status": "candi