{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_39", "source_id": "63072d4c000000001b01d33f", "title": "告别猪肝红！告别乌唇！深唇变浅唇经验分享！", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63072d4c000000001b01d33f", "topic_family": "毛孔与清洁", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "正常经验内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1091, "evidence_unit_count": 33, "original_evidence_unit_count": 33, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 101, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小三零 這次我要跟你們分享一個 不懷一分錢就能夠讓生存變淺純的方法", "我就發現我的氣色變好了 素顏的時候不會有病態感了 他的原理就是當我們在盤腿明顯的時候", "再把這注意力又拉回來 放回呼吸上就可以了 每天冥想15到30分鐘", "到第二天早上嘴上都是潤潤的 之後用洗臉精稍微的搓一搓 能搓掉一些死皮", "大家給你們 那我們下期見 拜拜", "一個是和我們人的氣血不通有關 還有一個是內心如果有長年累接下來的情緒壓抑", "我就發現我的氣色變好了 素顏的時候不會有病態感了 他的原理就是當我們在盤腿明顯的時候"], "retained_quotes": ["一個是和我們人的氣血不通有關 還有一個是內心如果有長年累接下來的情緒壓抑", "我就發現我的氣色變好了 素顏的時候不會有病態感了 他的原理就是當我們在盤腿明顯的時候"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63072d4c000000001b01d33f/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63072d4c000000001b01d33f/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63072d4c000000001b01d33f/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63072d4c000000001b01d33f/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "a50fb578a8c45194a6cf7db2fa6cffc12352d4fb9d043057ae07f5c002e1c310", "card_hash": "113623a1d0748c7fcf47b2c1da5bf7c46409cf48870a7ea5f1c3832bb38ea00b", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_39", "source_id": "6304d6c0000000001902be1a", "title": "清洁是痘痘肌养成好皮肤的第一步", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6304d6c0000000001902be1a", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 821, "evidence_unit_count": 21, "original_evidence_unit_count": 21, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["清洁是我觉得在护肤当中最重要的一步，其实护肤里只要做好 清洁、保湿、防晒，皮肤就已经可以很好了", "这款艾天然卸妆液是我很喜欢的卸妆产品，是专门针对我们油痘肌开发的，非常轻薄的凝露质地，完全不油腻", "卸妆力的话，因为它是非常温和的洁面产品 所以一些非常防水的睫毛膏、眼线笔这些我们就交给眼唇卸妆液", "卸妆对好皮肤很重要 假睫毛、眉毛、口红、粉底、", "温和养肤 Attenl AQUA", "卸妆力的话，因为它是非常温和的洁面产品 所以一些非常防水的睫毛膏、眼线笔这些我们就交给眼唇卸妆液", "所以，有一个好的清洁产品是油痘皮、油敏皮养成好皮肤的第一步"], "retained_quotes": ["卸妆力的话，因为它是非常温和的洁面产品 所以一些非常防水的睫毛膏、眼线笔这些我们就交给眼唇卸妆液", "所以，有一个好的清洁产品是油痘皮、油敏皮养成好皮肤的第一步"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6304d6c0000000001902be1a/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6304d6c0000000001902be1a/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6304d6c0000000001902be1a/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6304d6c0000000001902be1a/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "3546a5326cd98164d6b9ce881dba6b6c73313d7ecd289cea702f53a8b7abec85", "card_hash": "f50c85f7001f5a592aeaf83553791fb83baf30e42e1e6c1ea6560fad7c50e2bf", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
